$ .venv/bin/python benchmarks/tblite/run.py --help
usage: run.py [-h] --label LABEL --arm {econo+jev,econo+prior,raw} --tasks
              TASKS --model MODEL [--gateway GATEWAY] [--repeats REPEATS]
              [--workers WORKERS] [--timeout-multiplier TIMEOUT_MULTIPLIER]

Run TBLite tasks with our agent (agents/react/agent.py), every model call
through gateway/.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --label LABEL
  --arm {econo+jev,econo+prior,raw}
  --tasks TASKS         comma-separated task names, or 'frozen' for the 10
  --model MODEL         the provider's model id, e.g. qwen3.8:27b
  --gateway GATEWAY
  --repeats REPEATS
  --workers WORKERS
  --timeout-multiplier TIMEOUT_MULTIPLIER
exit 0
